 where each hald adder only counts\ntill 2. all assign statments fire all at once, i still dont know shit about flip flop\nor digital circuits", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 49, "containerId": null, "originalText": "you: two hald adders, conncected to count till 3 where each hald adder only counts\ntill 2. all assign statments fire all at once, i still dont know shit about flip flop\nor digital circuits", "lineHeight": 1.15}], "files": {"89371539521539731783524567827": {"id": "89371539521539731783524567827", "dataURL": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,", "mimeType": "image/svg+xml", "created": 1783524567827}, "94539013384837561783524567868": {"id": "94539013384837561783524567868", "dataURL": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,", "mimeType": "image/svg+xml", "created": 1783524567868}}}